<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Eny · Hair, with a little more heart</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/style.css"></head><body>
<div class="demo-note">Fictional salon · real booking workflow · your private demo clears after 96 hours</div>
<header><a href="/" class="wordmark">eny<span>HAIR SALON</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/?page=services">The care menu</a><a href="/?page=about">Our story</a><a href="/?page=contact">Say hello</a><a class="button small" href="/?page=book">Find your moment ↗</a></nav></header>
<main><% if(error){ %><p role="alert" class="notice error"><%= error %></p><% } %><% if(notice){ %><p role="status" class="notice"><%= notice %></p><% } %>
<% if(page==='home'){ %><%- include('home') %>
<% }else if(page==='services'){ %><section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE CARE MENU</p><h1>Good things.<br><em>Fair prices.</em></h1><p>Original coursework prices, preserved in this restored demo.</p></section><div class="menu-list"><% for(const [name,price] of Object.entries(SERVICES)){ %><a href="/?page=book"><h2><%= name %></h2><span>$<%= price.toFixed(2) %> ↗</span></a><% } %></div>
<% }else if(page==='about'){ %><section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p><h1>Haircare with<br><em>a human touch.</em></h1><p>Eny is a fictional neighborhood salon, restored from Andres’s PHP coursework. The original idea was simple: make it easy to find a service, reserve a real appointment and keep the salon’s calendar in order.</p></section><section class="story"><span class="sun">✳</span><div><h2>A little care goes a long way.</h2><p>This fresh design keeps the original booking, customer details, availability and administration workflows. This hosted edition uses Node.js and a persistent database; the original PHP edition is preserved with the project.</p><a class="button" href="/?page=book">Find your moment ↗</a></div></section>
<% }else if(page==='book'){ %><section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">MAKE A LITTLE TIME FOR YOU</p><h1>Your chair<br><em>is waiting.</em></h1><p>Choose a moment in the next two weeks. Use fictional details while exploring this demo.</p></section><div class="booking-layout"><aside><span class="sun">✳</span><h2>Less rushing.<br>More you.</h2><p>Your time is reserved when you confirm. Each appointment can only be booked once in your private workspace.</p><p class="tiny">Your demo records expire after 96 hours. Confirmation messages stay in your demo outbox. No email is sent.</p></aside><form method="post" class="panel"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="book"><input type="hidden" name="website" value=""><label>Your appointment<select name="slot" required><option value="">Choose a day & time</option><% for(const slot of available(ws)){ %><option value="<%= slot %>" <%= values.slot===slot?'selected':'' %>><%= formatSlot(slot) %></option><% } %></select></label><%- include('customer') %><button class="button" type="submit">Confirm my appointment ↗</button></form></div>
<% }else if(page==='confirmation'){ %><section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SOMETHING TO LOOK FORWARD TO</p><h1>You’re booked.<br><em>See you soon.</em></h1><div class="panel confirmation"><p>Booking <%= appointment.id.slice(0,6) %> · <%= appointment.name %></p><h2><%= appointment.service %></h2><p><%= formatSlot(appointment.slot) %></p><p><%= appointment.extras.join(', ') %></p><p class="tiny">Your confirmation is saved to your demo outbox. No email was sent. This private demo expires after 96 hours.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/?page=admin">Open your salon workspace ↗</a></section>
<% }else if(page==='contact'){ %><section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">SAY HELLO</p><h1>Let’s talk<br><em>good hair.</em></h1><p>Have a question? Leave a message in your private fictional salon inbox. No email is sent.</p></section><form method="post" class="panel narrow"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="contact"><label>Your name<input name="name" maxlength="100" required value="<%= values.name||'' %>"></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" maxlength="200" required value="<%= values.email||'' %>"></label><label>Your message<textarea name="message" rows="5" maxlength="2000" required><%= values.message||'' %></textarea></label><button class="button">Save message ↗</button><p class="tiny">Demo only. Please don’t enter personal or sensitive information.</p></form>
<% }else if(page==='login'){ %><section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE CHAIR</p><h1>The salon<br><em>workspace.</em></h1><p>Explore appointments and availability in a private demo. Your changes never affect another visitor.</p></section><form method="post" class="panel narrow"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="start"><h2>Make yourself at home.</h2><p>Start with fictional sample data. Everything you add clears after 96 hours.</p><button class="button">Open a private demo ↗</button></form><form method="post" class="panel narrow"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="login"><h2>Welcome back.</h2><p>Saved a workspace name and password? Pick up where you left off before it expires.</p><label>Workspace name<input name="username" maxlength="40" required autocomplete="username"></label><label>Password<input type="password" name="password" required maxlength="128" autocomplete="current-password"></label><button class="button">Sign in ↗</button></form>
<% }else { %><section class="workspace-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE CHAIR · PRIVATE DEMO</p><h1>Today, <em>handled.</em></h1><p class="tiny">This workspace expires <%= new Date(ws.expiresAt).toLocaleString('en-US',{timeZone:'America/New_York',dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'}) %> ET. Using it does not extend its lifetime.</p></div><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="logout"><button class="text-link">Sign out ↗</button></form></section><nav class="tabs" aria-label="Staff navigation"><a href="/?page=admin">Appointments</a><a href="/?page=availability">Availability</a><a href="/?page=inbox">Messages & outbox</a></nav>
<% if(page==='admin'){ %><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Guest</th><th>Appointment</th><th>Care</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const a of [...ws.appointments].sort((a,b)=>a.slot.localeCompare(b.slot))){ %><tr><td><strong><%= a.name %></strong><small><%= a.email %><%= a.isSample?' · Sample guest':'' %></small></td><td><%= formatSlot(a.slot) %></td><td><%= a.service %><small><%= a.extras.join(', ') %></small></td><td><a href="/?page=edit&id=<%= a.id %>">Edit ↗</a></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div><% if(!ws.username){ %><form class="panel narrow" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="save-access"><h2>Come back to your workspace.</h2><p>Optional: choose a fictional workspace name and a unique demo password. It will still expire at the time shown above.</p><label>Workspace name<input name="username" minlength="3" maxlength="40" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_-]+" required autocomplete="username"></label><label>New demo password<input type="password" name="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" required autocomplete="new-password"></label><button class="button">Save sign-in details ↗</button></form><% }else{ %><p class="notice">Your workspace name is <strong><%= ws.username %></strong>. Sign in again before this demo expires.</p><% } %>
<% }else if(page==='availability'){ %><p class="notice">Booked appointments cannot be reopened here. Edit a booking to move it to another time.</p><div class="slots"><% for(const slot of ws.slots){ const booked=ws.appointments.some(a=>a.slot===slot); %><form method="post" class="slot"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="availability"><input type="hidden" name="slot" value="<%= slot %>"><strong><%= formatSlot(slot) %></strong><button <%= booked?'disabled':'' %>><%= booked?'Reserved':(ws.blocked.includes(slot)?'Blocked · reopen':'Available · block') %></button></form><% } %></div>
<% }else if(page==='inbox'){ %><h2>Guest messages</h2><% if(!ws.messages.length){ %><p>No messages yet. Try the contact form with fictional details.</p><% } %><% for(const m of [...ws.messages].reverse()){ %><article class="panel"><h3><%= m.name %></h3><p><%= m.email %></p><p><%= m.body %></p></article><% } %><h2>Confirmation outbox</h2><p>Saved to your private demo. These messages have not been sent.</p><% for(const m of [...ws.outbox].reverse()){ %><article class="panel"><h3><%= m.subject %></h3><p><%= m.recipient %></p><p><%= m.body %></p></article><% } %>
<% }else if(page==='edit'){ %><form method="post" class="panel narrow"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="edit"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<%= appointment.id %>"><h2>Edit appointment</h2><label>Appointment time<select name="slot"><% for(const slot of ws.slots.filter(s=>s===appointment.slot||available(ws).includes(s))){ %><option value="<%= slot %>" <%= slot===appointment.slot?'selected':'' %>><%= formatSlot(slot) %></option><% } %></select></label><%- include('customer') %><button class="button">Save appointment ↗</button></form><% } %>
<% } %></main><footer><a class="wordmark" href="/">eny<span>HAIR SALON</span></a><p>Good hair. A little more heart.</p><a href="/?page=login">Staff workspace ↗</a><small>Fictional demo · Original PHP coursework by Andres · Node.js hosted edition · Restored 2026</small></footer></body></html>
